{
  "schema": 1,
  "comment": "The owner checks of the repository paths, read by scripts/kit/owner-check.mjs: make owner-check runs the targets and node test files of the rules whose globs match a changed path. Every tracked path matches a rule; always lists the tests that run for every change. A rule with variable passes the matched paths to its targets in that make variable. Globs: * within one path segment, ** across segments, {a,b} either alternative. inputs declares, for a check, the globs of the paths that it reads; owner-check fails when a rule of such a path does not select the check or a target that runs it as a prerequisite.",
